      "uid": "zhcn:6a31de49de239e66b1e3c24a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善小姐也说，\r\n『就算现在依旧不是最完美的状态，\r\n我也打算作为“现在的我”继续向前奔跑。』",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc60c1dd7000ec4ecff6e269b464f250232fec8a1768f41fe0a27c7b47fc8083",
